## Appearance

Captain Vaelric Thorne is a towering red dragonborn officer of the Eternal Accord, standing nearly seven feet tall with burnished crimson scales and a scar running across his snout. Clad in dark, polished plate armor etched with the Accord’s sigil and draped in a black cloak lined with red, he carries himself with rigid discipline and quiet authority. His amber eyes burn with a cold, measuring intensity, and faint heat sometimes curls from his nostrils as he breathes. Thorne rarely raises his voice, yet his calm, deliberate tone and unwavering posture make his presence deeply intimidating, as if judgment has already been passed the moment he steps into a room.

## Traits
Authority of the Accord

Creatures allied with Captain Thorne within 30 ft gain +2 to attack rolls and saving throws while they can see or hear him.

Enemies must succeed on a DC 16 Wisdom save when first entering this aura or suffer disadvantage on their first attack against him.

## Tactical Commander

Once per round, Captain Thorne can allow an ally within 30 ft to make a weapon attack as a reaction.